  "request": "Inside the bodies of functions and methods in the click library (src/click/), where is a module-level function or a method defined in the repository passed by reference as an argument to another call (so the receiving call is expected to invoke it) rather than being called at that point? Module-level code outside any function, and nested helper functions, do not count. Give the symbol ID of the function or method containing the call and the symbol ID of the function passed, one row per distinct pair.\n\nRequested output columns: passing_symbol_id (string), passed_symbol_id (string).",
  "explanation": "This joins calls made from within click functions/methods to symbols whose name matches the callee name, restricting to repository-defined functions and methods and to calls whose line falls inside the caller's body but not the passed symbol's body (the argument reference rather than invocation). It returns distinct caller/passed pairs.",
  "sql": "WITH funcs AS (\n  SELECT s.symbol_id, s.file_id, s.line_start, s.line_end, s.name\n  FROM code.symbols s\n  JOIN code.files f ON f.file_id = s.file_id\n  WHERE s.kind IN ('function','method')\n    AND f.package = 'click'\n)\nSELECT DISTINCT f.symbol_id AS passing_symbol_id, s2.symbol_id AS passed_symbol_id\nFROM funcs f\nJOIN code.calls c ON c.caller_symbol_id = f.symbol_id\nJOIN code.symbols s2 ON s2.name = c.callee_name\nJOIN code.files f2 ON f2.file_id = s2.file_id\nWHERE s2.kind IN ('function','method')\n  AND c.line BETWEEN f.line_start AND f.line_end\n  AND c.line BETWEEN s2.line_start AND s2.line_end IS NOT TRUE\n  AND s2.symbol_id <> f.symbol_id\n  AND f2.package = 'click'",
